      "text": "1. Register(gvr, GVK, handler)\n   └─ GVK passed explicitly from CRD spec\n\n2. MulticlusterDynamicController\n   └─ Wraps N DynamicControllers (one per cluster)\n\n3. LazyInformer.AddHandlerWithOptions()\n   └─ Remote: waitForSync=false (non-blocking)\n\n4. CRD may not exist on remote clusters yet\n   └─ Informer retries in background",
